### Third-Party Skills & Attributions

This repository includes battle-tested engineering skills and helper personas from the open source community to provide a complete, self-contained agent experience. These skills are the property of their respective original authors:

1. **Superpowers Engineering Skills**
   - Skills: `systematic-debugging`, `test-driven-development`, `verification-before-completion`
   - Author: Jesse Vincent
   - Upstream Repository: https://github.com/obra/superpowers
   - License: MIT License

2. **Caveman**
   - Skill: `caveman`
   - Author: Julius Brussee
   - Upstream Repository: https://github.com/JuliusBrussee/caveman
   - License: MIT License / Apache 2.0

3. **Ponytail**
   - Skill: `ponytail`
   - Author: Dietrich Gebert
   - Upstream Repository: https://github.com/DietrichGebert/ponytail
   - License: MIT License
